        "Title": "BCR Vol. 95 - Fishy Business",
        "Location": "LOCATION_MIAMI",
        "PublicId": "111828531751",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/miami/scene_flamingo.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 14ef9606-229b-4ee5-9f79-bd8fa7893e1e).Image",
        "Description": "&quot;What is that smell? Something seems fishy.&quot;\r\r&quot;That&apos;s just Joe, 47. Fishy Joe.&quot;\r\r&quot;Oh, well. He lives up to the name.&quot;\r\rFive Targets have gathered at the Global Innovation Race in Miami. Fishy Joe is meeting his longtime partner, the infamous Florida Man, who escaped us in Berlin. Two couriers posing as visitors will deliver their package, while an employee provides access. This is our chance to dismantle the entire network. Eliminate all five, 47-and try not to cause a splash.\r\rGood luck.\r-Twice",
        "GameVersion": "8.24.0.0",
